{"version":2,"slug":"learn-in-on-at-naturally-english-listening-practice","videoId":"kjZ4pJfpfYE","videoUrl":"https://youtu.be/kjZ4pJfpfYE","lang":"en","title":"Learn IN, ON & AT Naturally | English Listening Practice","category":"Daily life","channel":"Miss Honey 🍯","channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/@Slow_English_Podcast","captionSource":"auto","tags":["English Conversation","learn english"],"backUrl":"/","lines":[{"start":0,"text":"Listen"},{"start":1,"text":"to this chaotic story"},{"start":5,"text":"while I naturally use"},{"start":8,"text":"in on and at."},{"start":12,"text":"Listen to this English story."},{"start":16,"text":"I am certain you will understand"},{"start":21,"text":"everything. Just"},{"start":24,"text":"relax,"},{"start":26,"text":"listen to the story and imagine the"},{"start":30,"text":"scenes in your mind. I recently went to"},{"start":37,"text":"the beach"},{"start":39,"text":"with my friends. We went to Puerto"},{"start":44,"text":"Escondido, a beautiful"},{"start":47,"text":"beach"},{"start":48,"text":"in Mexico. It is on the coast of the"},{"start":55,"text":"Pacific Ocean."},{"start":58,"text":"It is famous"},{"start":61,"text":"for big waves,"},{"start":64,"text":"beautiful"},{"start":65,"text":"sunsets,"},{"start":67,"text":"and warm weather"},{"start":70,"text":"all year long."},{"start":73,"text":"It was a chaotic trip"},{"start":77,"text":"to the beach. It started"},{"start":81,"text":"very early"},{"start":83,"text":"in the morning. We woke up"},{"start":87,"text":"at"},{"start":420,"text":"["},{"start":420.6,"text":"a.m. Everyone was still"},{"start":421.2,"text":"[sighs]"},{"start":421.8,"text":"tired,"},{"start":422.4,"text":"yawning"},{"start":423,"text":"in bed."},{"start":423.6,"text":"I was still in bed"},{"start":424.2,"text":"when the alarm"},{"start":424.8,"text":"started ringing."},{"start":425.4,"text":"My friend was sitting"},{"start":426,"text":"on the edge of the bed"},{"start":426.6,"text":"looking at his phone."},{"start":427.2,"text":"The sunlight"},{"start":427.8,"text":"was coming in"},{"start":428.4,"text":"through the window."},{"start":429,"text":"My backpack"},{"start":429.6,"text":"was already on the floor"},{"start":430.2,"text":"next to the bed."},{"start":430.8,"text":"My water bottle"},{"start":431.4,"text":"was on the table"},{"start":432,"text":"next to me."},{"start":432.6,"text":"Nobody wanted to wake up, but"},{"start":433.2,"text":"we wanted to leave at"},{"start":480,"text":"a.m."},{"start":480.6,"text":"sharp"},{"start":481.2,"text":"because the drive"},{"start":481.8,"text":"was going to be 9 hours. So,"},{"start":482.4,"text":"we quickly packed our bags. I made sure"},{"start":483,"text":"everything was in my bag. My sunglasses"},{"start":483.6,"text":"were in the front pocket. My towel"},{"start":484.2,"text":"was in the bottom"},{"start":484.8,"text":"of my bag."},{"start":485.4,"text":"And my charger"},{"start":486,"text":"was in the back pocket. We put our"},{"start":486.6,"text":"backpacks"},{"start":487.2,"text":"in the van"},{"start":487.8,"text":"and our snacks"},{"start":488.4,"text":"on the seats."},{"start":489,"text":"And finally,"},{"start":489.6,"text":"everyone got in"},{"start":490.2,"text":"the van."},{"start":490.8,"text":"And we started our trip. The drive was"},{"start":491.4,"text":"very long. We were in the van for 9"},{"start":492,"text":"hours."},{"start":492.6,"text":"Some people"},{"start":493.2,"text":"were sleeping"},{"start":493.8,"text":"in the back of the van."},{"start":494.4,"text":"Some put their feet"},{"start":495,"text":"on the seat in front of them."},{"start":495.6,"text":"One friend was drawing"},{"start":496.2,"text":"on her notebook."},{"start":496.8,"text":"And I was reading"},{"start":497.4,"text":"my book. And at first"},{"start":498,"text":"everyone"},{"start":498.6,"text":"was excited listening to music on the"},{"start":499.2,"text":"speakers"},{"start":499.8,"text":"and talking in the back of the van"},{"start":500.4,"text":"playing games"},{"start":501,"text":"on our phones."},{"start":501.6,"text":"But after a few hours"},{"start":502.2,"text":"everyone got"},{"start":502.8,"text":"tired."},{"start":503.4,"text":"There were not enough seats"},{"start":504,"text":"in the van."},{"start":504.6,"text":"So sometimes"},{"start":505.2,"text":"someone had to sit"},{"start":505.8,"text":"on the floor."},{"start":506.4,"text":"But the road"},{"start":507,"text":"was so curvy."},{"start":507.6,"text":"There were so many bumps"},{"start":508.2,"text":"on the highway."},{"start":508.8,"text":"And every time the van hit"},{"start":509.4,"text":"a bump"},{"start":510,"text":"the person sitting on the floor"},{"start":510.6,"text":"would fly."},{"start":511.2,"text":"Everyone in the van"},{"start":511.8,"text":"would start to laugh."},{"start":512.4,"text":"At one point my friend was lying on the"},{"start":513,"text":"floor"},{"start":513.6,"text":"eating"},{"start":514.2,"text":"a bag of chips."},{"start":514.8,"text":"And when the van"},{"start":515.4,"text":"hit a big bump,"},{"start":516,"text":"the chips"},{"start":516.6,"text":"they went flying"},{"start":517.2,"text":"everywhere in the van."},{"start":517.8,"text":"There were chips on the seats,"},{"start":518.4,"text":"on the floor, and even inside some"},{"start":519,"text":"backpacks."},{"start":519.6,"text":"We played music on the stereo."},{"start":520.2,"text":"We told stories,"},{"start":520.8,"text":"and we ate snacks in the van."},{"start":521.4,"text":"After many long hours"},{"start":522,"text":"in the van,"},{"start":522.6,"text":"we arrived in Puerto Escondido."},{"start":523.2,"text":"We arrived"},{"start":523.8,"text":"at"},{"start":524.4,"text":"in the afternoon."},{"start":525,"text":"We opened the van doors,"},{"start":525.6,"text":"and we felt"},{"start":526.2,"text":"the fresh humid air."},{"start":526.8,"text":"Nothing like the contaminated"},{"start":527.4,"text":"air in Mexico City."},{"start":528,"text":"The sky was golden, and the sun"},{"start":528.6,"text":"was low."},{"start":529.2,"text":"And that night,"},{"start":529.8,"text":"we had dinner"},{"start":530.4,"text":"at a restaurant near the beach. We were"},{"start":531,"text":"sitting"},{"start":531.6,"text":"at a table outside. There were lights on"},{"start":532.2,"text":"the trees,"},{"start":532.8,"text":"and music playing"},{"start":533.4,"text":"in the background."},{"start":534,"text":"Everyone was very"},{"start":534.6,"text":"tired at dinner."},{"start":535.2,"text":"But, also very excited. Later that"},{"start":535.8,"text":"night,"},{"start":536.4,"text":"we slept in our Airbnb. But,"},{"start":537,"text":"we didn't sleep for long. The next"},{"start":537.6,"text":"morning,"},{"start":538.2,"text":"we woke up at"},{"start":538.8,"text":"a.m. again."},{"start":539.4,"text":"Everyone was still tired"},{"start":540,"text":"in the morning, but"},{"start":540.6,"text":"since we were so excited,"},{"start":541.2,"text":"we walked together"},{"start":541.8,"text":"to the beach. And soon,"},{"start":542.4,"text":"we were standing"},{"start":543,"text":"on the beach looking at the ocean. The"},{"start":543.6,"text":"sun was hot on our skin, and the salt"},{"start":544.2,"text":"was in the air. Then, we sat on our"},{"start":544.8,"text":"towels,"},{"start":545.4,"text":"and we watched the big waves"},{"start":546,"text":"crash onto the shore. And my friends"},{"start":546.6,"text":"were all ready in the water. They were"},{"start":547.2,"text":"jumping into the waves and laughing. I"},{"start":547.8,"text":"was standing on the sand watching them."},{"start":548.4,"text":"I saw how a huge wave"},{"start":549,"text":"pulled my friend by his feet"},{"start":549.6,"text":"and smashed him onto the shore."},{"start":550.2,"text":"And for a moment, he disappeared"},{"start":550.8,"text":"in the water,"},{"start":551.4,"text":"but then he came back laughing."},{"start":554,"text":"It was so scary."},{"start":556,"text":"Later,"},{"start":557,"text":"I heard two people"},{"start":560,"text":"walking on the beach"},{"start":563,"text":"saying,"},{"start":565,"text":"\"I don't know how to swim."},{"start":569,"text":"Do you?\""},{"start":571,"text":"And the other responded,"},{"start":574,"text":"\"No, me neither."},{"start":576,"text":"But it's okay."},{"start":578,"text":"And they both walked"},{"start":581,"text":"to the ocean to swim."},{"start":585,"text":"They got in"},{"start":587,"text":"and immediately"},{"start":589,"text":"the ocean"},{"start":592,"text":"spit them"},{"start":594,"text":"right out."},{"start":597,"text":"The ocean said, \"Get out.\""},{"start":601,"text":"And fortunately they did. We have to"},{"start":605,"text":"respect"},{"start":607,"text":"the ocean."},{"start":608,"text":"It's much stronger than we are. Later"},{"start":613,"text":"we played volleyball"},{"start":616,"text":"on the beach. The net"},{"start":620,"text":"was buried in the sand. The ball kept on"},{"start":625,"text":"falling"},{"start":627,"text":"on the ground and sometimes it rolled"},{"start":632,"text":"into the ocean. We bought the volleyball"},{"start":637,"text":"at the market."},{"start":640,"text":"We also bought a football at the store."},{"start":645,"text":"The football kept on flying in the air"},{"start":651,"text":"and landing on the sand. We listened to"},{"start":656,"text":"music on a small speaker. We watched"},{"start":661,"text":"surfers"},{"start":663,"text":"on their boards"},{"start":666,"text":"and we relaxed"},{"start":668,"text":"in the sun. At sunset"},{"start":672,"text":"we were all sitting on our huge blanket"},{"start":678,"text":"watching the sky change colors. The"},{"start":683,"text":"blanket was 5 m long."},{"start":687,"text":"And the sun was slowly"},{"start":691,"text":"disappearing"},{"start":692,"text":"into the ocean."},{"start":695,"text":"It was one of the most beautiful sunsets"},{"start":700,"text":"I have ever seen. Where was the most"},{"start":704,"text":"beautiful sunset"},{"start":707,"text":"you have ever seen?"},{"start":709,"text":"But,"},{"start":710,"text":"the craziest moment"},{"start":713,"text":"happened on our last night."},{"start":718,"text":"Just before"},{"start":720,"text":"we left, we finished having dinner"},{"start":724,"text":"at a Thai restaurant."},{"start":728,"text":"I love Thai food. I ordered pad see ew,"},{"start":733,"text":"my favorite dish."},{"start":735,"text":"I ate all the noodles on my plate,"},{"start":741,"text":"and we started walking back"},{"start":745,"text":"to the van."},{"start":747,"text":"It was dark in the streets, and there"},{"start":751,"text":"were only a few lights"},{"start":755,"text":"on the road. The tow truck was parked in"},{"start":761,"text":"the middle of the street. The lights"},{"start":765,"text":"were flashing"},{"start":767,"text":"on the truck, and a white van"},{"start":771,"text":"was sitting"},{"start":772,"text":"on"},{"start":774,"text":"the back of it. My friend laughed and"},{"start":778,"text":"said,"},{"start":779,"text":"\"Can you imagine if that van was ours?"},{"start":784,"text":"That would be so funny.\""},{"start":789,"text":"[laughter and gasps]"},{"start":789.6,"text":"And I said the same. As we walked closer"},{"start":794,"text":"and closer to the van,"},{"start":798,"text":"we realized that was our van."},{"start":803,"text":"It was our big Gombe van. We looked at"},{"start":809,"text":"the color,"},{"start":811,"text":"at the stickers,"},{"start":813,"text":"at the license plates. Our van was on"},{"start":817,"text":"the tow truck. We stood there laughing"},{"start":821,"text":"in the street"},{"start":823,"text":"because we couldn't believe it. We"},{"start":826,"text":"parked on the wrong street."},{"start":832,"text":"But, there were no signs on that street."},{"start":838,"text":"But, our van was already on the truck."},{"start":843,"text":"So, we had to climb onto the van and"},{"start":848,"text":"take all our stuff out"},{"start":851,"text":"before they took it. We went to the"},{"start":855,"text":"towing office"},{"start":858,"text":"and we paid at the desk and we finally"},{"start":863,"text":"got our van back. The next morning, we"},{"start":868,"text":"woke up"},{"start":869,"text":"at"},{"start":869.6,"text":"a.m. again. We got in the van"},{"start":875,"text":"and we were on the road 9 hours later."},{"start":882,"text":"We were in the city"},{"start":885,"text":"again. It was a chaotic trip,"},{"start":889,"text":"but also one of my favorite. Have you"},{"start":894,"text":"ever had a chaotic trip like this?"},{"start":899,"text":"What happened?"},{"start":901,"text":"Tell me about it using in, on, and at."},{"start":905,"text":"Please."},{"start":907,"text":"Something to remember when you watch"},{"start":910,"text":"this video again, in, on, and at are"},{"start":914,"text":"prepositions."},{"start":916,"text":"They can be time prepositions"},{"start":920,"text":"or place prepositions."},{"start":924,"text":"Try and notice when I use each one in"},{"start":929,"text":"this story. For example,"},{"start":931,"text":"at"},{"start":931.6,"text":"a.m."},{"start":934,"text":"in the morning."},{"start":937,"text":"Those are time prepositions."},{"start":939,"text":"At the store, on the floor."},{"start":944,"text":"Those are place prepositions."},{"start":947,"text":"I'm going to leave these two charts"},{"start":949,"text":"here. They explain prepositions and when"},{"start":952,"text":"to use them perfectly."},{"start":955,"text":"Like a little pyramid."},{"start":958,"text":"Now, try and make your own sentences"},{"start":962,"text":"using in, on, and at. All right, guys. I"},{"start":966,"text":"will see you next week."},{"start":968,"text":"Have a wonderful day,"},{"start":971,"text":"and remember,"},{"start":972,"text":"never stop learning."},{"start":976,"text":"Bye."}]}